</style></head><body><main class="wrap"><header class="top"><div><div class="brand"><span>CURSED</span> &amp;<br>RETURNED</div><div class="subtitle">SECOND CHANCES THRIFT & PAWN · NO REFUNDS, NO EXORCISMS</div></div><div class="tag">👻 THE CLOSING SHIFT FROM HELL (figuratively)</div></header><section id="intro" class="panel intro"><div><h1>You're on the clock.<br>The merchandise is possessed.</h1><p>Meet <b>Kai</b>, a teenage thrift-store employee who just wanted a normal paycheck. Eight cursed donations are terrorizing the store. Remove their magical seals by <b>undoing the operation furthest from x first</b>.</p><p>Catch the correct inverse spell on the moving belt. After every correct spell, <b>the timer freezes</b> so you can see the operation applied to <b>both sides</b> and the simplified equation. Press Continue when you're ready.</p><div class="levels"><label><input type="radio" name="mode" value="chill"><b>👻 Casual Haunting</b><small>No timer · stationary spells</small></label><label><input type="radio" name="mode" value="rush" checked><b>⚡ Night Shift</b><small>45 sec/object · moving spells</small></label><label><input type="radio" name="mode" value="chaos"><b>💀 Full Possession</b><small>25 sec/object · faster spells</small></label></div><button class="btn" id="start" type="button">CLOCK IN →</button><p class="fine muted">Click or tap spells. Keyboard: 1–4. Wrong spells raise the Haunt-O-Meter. The timer pauses for every explanation.</p></div><div class="hero">🧑🏻‍🔧<br>👻<br>📺</div></section><section id="game" class="hidden"><div class="hud"><div class="stat">CURSED ITEM<strong id="itemNo">1 / 8</strong></div><div class="stat">SHIFT SCORE<strong id="score">0</strong></div><div class="stat">TIME LEFT<strong id="time">45s</strong></div><div class="stat">COMBO<strong id="combo">0 🔥</strong></div></div><div class="barrow"><div><label>📦 INVENTORY CLEARED <span id="inventoryLabel">0 / 8</span></label><div class="bar"><div id="inventoryBar"></div></div></div><div><label>👻 HAUNT-O-METER <span id="hauntLabel">0%</span></label><div class="bar haunt"><div id="hauntBar"></div></div></div></div><section class="panel arena" id="arena"><div class="story"><div class="character">🧑🏻‍🔧</div><div class="bubble"><div class="objecttitle" id="itemTitle"></div><div id="itemJoke"></div></div><div class="character" id="objectIcon">🍞</div></div><div class="equationbox"><div class="eqnote">CURSE EQUATION · REMOVE THE OUTERMOST OPERATION FIRST</div><div class="equation" id="equation"></div><div class="eqnote" id="stepCount"></div></div><div class="comic">⬅ CATCH THE CORRECT INVERSE SPELL ➡</div><div class="conveyor"><div class="tokens" id="tokens"></div></div><div class="msg" id="message" aria-live="polite"></div><div class="footer"><span class="progressSteps" id="hint">Do the same operation to BOTH sides.</span><button class="tinybtn" id="restart">↻ Restart shift</button></div></section><section class="panel"><b>📜 CURSE-BREAKING LOG</b><div class="log" id="log"></div></section></section></main><div class="overlay hidden" id="inventoryScene"><div class="dialog scene-dialog"><div class="comic" id="sceneLabel">CURSED DONATION</div><h2 id="sceneTitle"></h2><img class="scene-image" id="sceneImage" alt="Comic illustration of the thrift-store item"><p id="sceneCaption"></p><button class="btn" id="sceneContinue">CLICK TO CONTINUE →</button><p class="fine muted">The timer is paused while this image is on screen.</p></div></div><div class="overlay hidden" id="explain"><div class="dialog"><div class="comic">✨ SPELL CAST — TIMER FROZEN ✨</div><h2>PROPERTY OF EQUALITY</h2><div class="detail" id="operationText"></div><div class="slime-caption">🧪 Green slime marks the inverse applied to both sides</div><div class="mathline slime-equation" id="equalityLine"></div><div class="arrow">⬇ SIMPLIFY ⬇</div><div class="slime-caption">✨ NEW CONSTANT AFTER SIMPLIFYING</div><div class="mathline slime-equation" id="simplifiedLine"></div><div class="detail" id="explainNote"></div><button class="btn" id="continue">CONTINUE →</button><p class="fine muted">Take the time you need. The timer will resume only when you continue.</p></div></div><div class="overlay hidden" id="verify"><div class="dialog"><div class="comic">🔍 GHOST-PROOF CHECK · TIMER FROZEN 🔍</div><h2>PROVE IT WORKS!</h2><p class="detail">A solution must make the ORIGINAL equation true. Fill in each missing value to prove your answer!</p><div class="slime-caption">👻 ORIGINAL CURSE EQUATION</div><div class="mathline" id="verifyOriginal"></div><div class="slime-caption">🧪 SUBSTITUTE THE VALUE FOR x</div><div class="mathline verify-substitution" id="verifySubstitution"></div><div id="verifyHistory" class="verify-work"></div><div id="verifyTask" class="verify-task"><label id="verifyPrompt" for="verifyInput">Simplify the next operation:</label><div class="verify-expression"><span id="verifyMath"></span> = <input id="verifyInput" class="verify-input" type="number" step="any" inputmode="decimal" autocomplete="off" aria-label="Enter the missing value"></div><p id="verifyFeedback" class="verify-feedback" aria-live="polite"></p><button class="btn" id="verifyCheck">CHECK MY VALUE →</button></div><div id="verifySuccess" class="verify-hidden"><div class="slime-caption">✨ BOTH SIDES MATCH!</div><div class="verify-equal" id="verifyResult"></div><p class="detail">Both sides are equal, so your solution works in the ORIGINAL equation!</p><button class="btn" id="verifyContinue">✓ CURSE CONFIRMED BROKEN →</button></div><p class="fine muted">No rush! The clock stays paused while you check your solution.</p></div></div><div class="overlay hidden" id="itemClear"><div class="dialog"><div style="font-size:65px" id="clearIcon">✨</div><h2 id="clearTitle">CURSE BROKEN!</h2><p id="clearJoke"></p><p id="clearSummary"></p><button class="btn" id="nextItem">NEXT DONATION →</button></div></div><div class="overlay hidden" id="ending"><div class="dialog"><div style="font-size:68px">🏆👻🛒</div><h2>SHIFT SURVIVED!</h2><p>Eight cursed objects. Zero paid overtime. Kai deserves a raise.</p><div class="mathline" id="finalScore"></div><p id="finalNote"></p><button class="btn" id="again">CLOCK IN AGAIN →</button></div></div><script>
(()=>{'use strict';const $=id=>document.getElementById(id);const items=[['🍞','THE SCREAMING TOASTER','It screams when you put bread in. It also screams when you don’t.','The toaster is now only mildly judgmental.'],['⏰','THE ALARM CLOCK FROM 1986','It has been ringing for forty years. Nobody knows how to snooze it.','The clock is quiet. Kai can finally hear himself regret this job.'],['🪆','THE DOLL WITH RECEIPTS','The doll can see the search history of students who are playing Minecraft in class. She is not impressed.','The doll has agreed to stop exposing people for playing Minecraft in class. Temporarily.'],['🪞','THE MIRROR WITH OPINIONS','It said your outfit was giving substitute teacher.','The mirror now keeps its opinions to itself.'],['🪔','THE EMOTIONALLY UNSTABLE LAVA LAMP','It cries when you turn it on. It cries when you turn it off.','The lamp has discovered emotional regulation.'],['🧹','THE VACUUM OF ETERNAL REGRET','It does not clean floors. It just sucks up your motivation.','The vacuum now collects dust instead of despair.'],['📺','THE TV OF EMBARRASSING MEMORIES','It has replayed your sixth-grade talent show for 45 minutes.','The TV is finally showing something less humiliating.'],['💰','THE REGISTER THAT DEMANDS TIPS','It charged a ghost a 30% service fee. The ghost is furious.','The register is no longer charging the dead. Management is disappointed.']];const introGifs=["data:image/webp;base64,", "data:image/webp;base64,", "data:image/webp;base64,", "data:image/webp;base64,", "data:image/webp;base64,", "data:image/webp;base64,", "data:image/webp;base64,", "data:image/webp;base64,"];const afterGifs=["data:image/webp;base64,", "data:image/webp;base64,", "data:image/webp;base64,", "data:image/webp;base64,", "data:image/webp;base64,", "data:image/webp;base64,", "data:image/webp;base64,", "data:image/webp;base64,"];let mode='rush',index=0,score=0,combo=0,haunt=0,remaining=45,ops=[],x=0,step=0,active=false,paused=false,clock=null,lastTick=0,mistakes=0,attemp